{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03159","headline":"南还湘水言怀 · 张九龄","name":"南还湘水言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拙宦今何有？劳歌念不成。\n十年乖夙志，一别悔前行。\n归去田园老，倘来轩冕轻。\n江间稻正熟，林里桂初荣。\n鱼意思在藻，鹿心怀食苹。\n时哉苟不达，取乐遂吾情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}